 `range` and `pr` reviews the right side is a read-only snapshot — the review tool does not
 check out other people's branches behind your back.
 
+**One side, one pane.** When a side has no content — an added file, a deleted one, a file
+that was empty — the base pane is closed and the remaining content fills the width with diff
+mode off. Two panes, one of them blank, with every line painted as an addition, say nothing
+that one pane does not; reading a new file is just reading a file. The pane comes back the
+moment there is something to compare again.
+
